%% title: The steps of paying fees
%% desc: A parent presses Pay on the Due this month card of Overview, ticks the bills, then pays with bKash or submits a payment proof. After bKash, the result page says Payment done, Waiting for confirmation or Payment not done. A submitted proof shows under My payment proofs.
flowchart TD
  C["Due this month"]:::guardian --> S["Tick bills"]:::guardian
  S --> H{"How to pay?"}:::note
  H -->|"bKash"| K["bKash page"]
  K --> Q{"Result"}:::note
  Q --> Q1["Payment done"]:::guardian
  Q --> Q2["Waiting for confirmation"]:::note
  Q --> Q3["Payment not done"]:::note
  H -->|"Already paid"| P["Submit proof"]:::guardian
  P --> M["My proofs"]:::note
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
